  "instructions": [
    "Heat a large pot over medium heat and add a couple of tablespoons of oil.",
    "Sauté the onion, garlic, and ginger until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the pork belly and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the anise, cloves, cinnamon sticks, fish sauce, vinegar, and black pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Pour in the water and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 1 hour.",
    "Add the dehydrated bok choy and cook for an additional 10 minutes.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired."
